{"ticker":{"symbol":"025890.KS","name":"한국주강","market":"KR","exchange":""},"currency":"KRW","price":2620.0,"change_pct":-0.015037593984962405,"market_cap":29198893056.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":0.0,"week52_high":2795.0,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Steel","country":"South Korea","city":"Haman-myeon","employees":null,"website":"https://www.hascokorea.co.kr","business_summary":"Hankook Steel Co., Ltd. manufactures and sells steel products in South Korea. The company offers castings, including rudder horns, propeller boss, lower casting, stern boss and tubes, and tillers for shipbuilding; crowns, frames, column, discharge heads, roll chocks, slag pots, tee dies, bending dies, girth gears, holding blocks, mill housing, tables, and trunnions for industrial purpose; and turbine casting, valve body, butterfly valves, and gate valves for power generation applications. It also provides ingot for forging, such as general, round, and E.S.R ingots. The company was founded in 1960 and is headquartered in Haman-myeon, South Korea.","business_summary_ko":"한국스틸(주)는 한국에서 철강 제품을 제조 및 판매하는 회사입니다. 이 회사는 러더 혼, 프로펠러 보스, 하부 캐스팅, 선미 보스 및 튜브, 조선용 경운기를 포함한 주조 제품을 제공합니다. 산업용 크라운, 프레임, 기둥, 배출 헤드, 롤 초크, 슬래그 포트, 티 다이, 벤딩 다이, 거스 기어, 홀딩 블록, 밀 하우징, 테이블 및 트러니언; 발전용 터빈 캐스팅, 밸브 본체, 버터플라이 밸브 및 게이트 밸브 등이 있습니다. 일반 잉곳, 원형 잉곳, E.S.R 잉곳 등 단조용 잉곳도 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1960년에 설립되었으며 본사는 대한민국 함안면에 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null},{"period":"2027","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":null}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"철강","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":54371102410.0,"operating_income":-517656100.0,"net_income":1721453110.0,"eps":154.0},{"period":"2023","revenue":53811233050.0,"operating_income":2418860930.0,"net_income":2495090200.0,"eps":224.0},{"period":"2024","revenue":47283741620.0,"operating_income":1074954400.0,"net_income":762134340.0,"eps":68.0},{"period":"2025","revenue":398722